  "about": "How Yaarbro is put together from his Meshy files, for tools/prepare-rigged.py and tools/pose-test.py. Times are seconds into a file's own clip. Heights are metres up from the ground on the model as it comes (he is 2.87 m tall there), 'within' is metres either side of his middle, and colours are the hue (0 to 360), saturation and value (0 to 1) of his picture.",

