  "grips_about": "His model has no finger bones, so anything he holds is held at a grip point in the middle of a palm, never at a wrist. For each hand: at is the grip point on the skin of the palm, palm is the way the palm faces and fingers the way the fingers run, all in the hand bone's own space as the model comes. rod is the way the rod runs through his right hand, and reel the side of the rod its reel hangs on. The preview page draws what he holds from these, and tools/preview/fishing-measure.mjs checks every frame of the fishing clips against them.",
